<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Methodology — BBI</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@latest/tabler-icons.min.css">
</head>
<body>
<nav class="nav">
  <a href="/" class="nav-logo">BBI <span>·</span> Bharat Business Index</a>
  <div class="nav-links"><a href="/">Home</a></div>
</nav>
<div style="background:#0D2E5E;padding:28px 40px">
  <h1 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:4px">How we rank businesses</h1>
  <p style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)">Transparent, independent, updated monthly</p>
</div>
<div class="section" style="max-width:720px">
  <% const steps = [
    ['Data collection','Review counts, ratings, website presence, and social signals collected from verified public sources every month.'],
    ['Automatic scoring','Each factor is scored against defined thresholds. Scores are weighted and combined into a final score out of 100.'],
    ['Editorial review','Our team manually reviews top businesses and may apply a quality score based on service standards.'],
    ['Monthly recalculation','Rankings are fully recalculated on the 1st of every month. All history is preserved — nothing is ever deleted.'],
    ['Sponsored integrity','Sponsored placements are clearly labeled and kept entirely separate from editorial rankings.'],
    ['How to improve','Businesses can improve their rank by growing reviews, completing their profile, and maintaining quality.']
  ] %>
  <% steps.forEach(([title, text], i) => { %>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f2f5">
    <div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0D2E5E;color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0"><%= i+1 %></div>
    <div>
      <div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#1A1A2E;margin-bottom:3px"><%= title %></div>
      <div style="font-size:13px;color:#4A5568"><%= text %></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <% }) %>

  <div style="background:#fef9ec;border:1px solid #fcd34d;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#92400e;margin-top:20px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
    <i class="ti ti-shield-check" style="font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0"></i>
    BBI's credibility depends on ranking integrity. Sponsored businesses can never automatically reach #1.
  </div>
</div>
<footer>
  <div class="logo">BBI <span>·</span> Bharat Business Index</div>
  <div class="footer-copy">© 2026 BBI. Rankings are independent.</div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
